# The documentation site's generator. requirements.txt pins it and everything
# it installs, with hashes; after changing a version here, regenerate it with
# pip-tools:
#
#   pip-compile --generate-hashes --output-file=website/requirements.txt website/requirements.in
#
# The pinned set installs on Python 3.11.5 or newer (pymdown-extensions 13.0
# needs it). CONTRIBUTING.md and AGENTS.md give that minimum; keep them in step
# when a new pin moves it.
zensical==0.1.1
